(5899986, 859046, 104230, '<td valign="top">Good shot overall. Technically excellent and visually interesting. I find myself wondering "why a leaf?" and there is something about its shape that imo detracts from the image, but I enjoy the light on its veins. I wonder if it would have been a stronger image with some separation between the base of the leaf and the adjacent dark area, just a thought. 7</td>', 'Good shot overall. Technically excellent and visually interesting. I find myself wondering "why a leaf?" and there is something about its shape that imo detracts from the image, but I enjoy the light on its veins. I wonder if it would have been a stronger image with some separation between the base of the leaf and the adjacent dark area, just a thought. 7', '2010-03-11 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899992, 859759, 12733, '<td valign="top">The shadows don''t seem to be the main focus, but rather a contrast to the sunlit subject.</td>', 'The shadows don''t seem to be the main focus, but rather a contrast to the sunlit subject.', '2010-03-11 12:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899994, 859446, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast of the subject and its shadow. Very nice.</td>', 'Interesting contrast of the subject and its shadow. Very nice.', '2010-03-11 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
