(5900009, 859418, 12733, '<td valign="top">If I said the shadows make up 10 percent of this picture, I would probably be exagerrating. It''s the lovely colors that make it, not the small shadows in one corner. Sorry, but I don''t see it as really meeting the challenge.</td>', 'If I said the shadows make up 10 percent of this picture, I would probably be exagerrating. It''s the lovely colors that make it, not the small shadows in one corner. Sorry, but I don''t see it as really meeting the challenge.', '2010-03-11 12:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
