(5900014, 859365, 96664, '<td valign="top">I dont think this one will do well because when people look at it they think to themselves... "this is just a last minute shot that you wanted to enter the challenge with" There really isnt any thought behind it.</td>', 'I dont think this one will do well because when people look at it they think to themselves... "this is just a last minute shot that you wanted to enter the challenge with" There really isnt any thought behind it.', '2010-03-11 12:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
