(5900715, 859603, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost looks as though he''s about to pick up a stick of dynomite.  Nice action shot of the birds in their rather inelegant poses.  I will say that I don''t really notice the shadows all that much though - the birds definitely steal the show.</td>', 'Almost looks as though he''s about to pick up a stick of dynomite.  Nice action shot of the birds in their rather inelegant poses.  I will say that I don''t really notice the shadows all that much though - the birds definitely steal the show.', '2010-03-11 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
