(5906358, 858758, 115436, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Lovely color and perspective.  And the soft lighting makes the scene melt in and out of shadows.</td>', 'Mmm. Lovely color and perspective.  And the soft lighting makes the scene melt in and out of shadows.', '2010-03-16 06:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906361, 859623, 115436, '<td valign="top">Ha! I know what I''m looking at sort of..and it''s intriguing!  I like the subject matter and the unique way we''re viewing it.  Reminds me of a Holga.</td>', 'Ha! I know what I''m looking at sort of..and it''s intriguing!  I like the subject matter and the unique way we''re viewing it.  Reminds me of a Holga.', '2010-03-16 06:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906364, 858984, 115436, '<td valign="top">I immediately thought this was a concrete pipe - it could almost be anything when it''s this close up!<br/>Nice texture and composition - the slow changing from dark to bright is even and just right - the shadows aren''t too dark and the light isn''t too bright.</td>', 'I immediately thought this was a concrete pipe - it could almost be anything when it''s this close up!Nice texture and composition - the slow changing from dark to bright is even and just right - the shadows aren''t too dark and the light isn''t too bright.', '2010-03-16 06:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906366, 859560, 115436, '<td valign="top">I love different perspectives and the high contrast is nice too.<br/>This is another picture that reminds me of a Holga.</td>', 'I love different perspectives and the high contrast is nice too.This is another picture that reminds me of a Holga.', '2010-03-16 06:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906367, 859597, 115436, '<td valign="top">It took me a second to grab the shadows out of the background! They''re very fine and dainty.<br/> <br/>I''m liking the composition but I can''t decide if the leaf in the corner is helping or distracting.  I also can''t decide if the flowers have grain or if they''re just fuzzy.</td>', 'It took me a second to grab the shadows out of the background! They''re very fine and dainty. I''m liking the composition but I can''t decide if the leaf in the corner is helping or distracting.  I also can''t decide if the flowers have grain or if they''re just fuzzy.', '2010-03-16 06:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906372, 859178, 115436, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of walking down a sidewalk and catching a quick glimpse of color out of the corner of your eye and turning at the last second to see what it is.<br/>You don''t get the full view and you keep on walking, content with that quick view.<br/> <br/>I keep thinking the composition is top heavy, but the white blurs in the background (on the bottom) continually pop up and remind me that they''re there. <br/> <br/>I wish the flower on the left had the last bit of its petal in the picture.</td>', 'It reminds me of walking down a sidewalk and catching a quick glimpse of color out of the corner of your eye and turning at the last second to see what it is.You don''t get the full view and you keep on walking, content with that quick view. I keep thinking the composition is top heavy, but the white blurs in the background (on the bottom) continually pop up and remind me that they''re there.  I wish the flower on the left had the last bit of its petal in the picture.', '2010-03-16 06:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906448, 859003, 81362, '<td valign="top">To my eye, the vast expanse of blue sky diminishes the road and shadows. Consider a square crop to balance the subjects, perhaps with an adjustment (curves, contrast, levels?) to make the shadows a little stronger.</td>', 'To my eye, the vast expanse of blue sky diminishes the road and shadows. Consider a square crop to balance the subjects, perhaps with an adjustment (curves, contrast, levels?) to make the shadows a little stronger.', '2010-03-16 09:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906449, 858286, 81362, '<td valign="top">Unusual and interesting pairing - "me and my shadow" as an alternative when overcast conditions erase the usual shadows. Might benefit from a mild boost in contrast.</td>', 'Unusual and interesting pairing - "me and my shadow" as an alternative when overcast conditions erase the usual shadows. Might benefit from a mild boost in contrast.', '2010-03-16 09:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906739, 859774, 61788, '<td valign="top">Excellent! First of all, light going through air and shadowy objects (trees in upper part) visible - very good exposure - things are enough light and enought dark to be visible and have details. Maybe not that much in the lower left, but here I think it is not that important. Composition created of 3 horizontal parts, and at the same time diagonally (left lower dark, upper right light). And details! Water drops! If someone expects to see shadows always casted on hard surface, then remind that shadows visible in the air are shadows too ;) Very good. Hopefully will manage to vote enough to be counted :)</td>', 'Excellent! First of all, light going through air and shadowy objects (trees in upper part) visible - very good exposure - things are enough light and enought dark to be visible and have details. Maybe not that much in the lower left, but here I think it is not that important. Composition created of 3 horizontal parts, and at the same time diagonally (left lower dark, upper right light). And details! Water drops! If someone expects to see shadows always casted on hard surface, then remind that shadows visible in the air are shadows too ;) Very good. Hopefully will manage to vote enough to be counted :)', '2010-03-16 14:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906741, 859623, 15711, '<td valign="top">That would''ve worked for Fine Art too.  I like that I had to study it.  COOL.</td>', 'That would''ve worked for Fine Art too.  I like that I had to study it.  COOL.', '2010-03-16 14:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906743, 859785, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very artsy and abstract!!</td>', 'Very artsy and abstract!!', '2010-03-16 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
