(5906753, 858516, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but would have preferred to just have the shadow on her face and shoulder and not the out of focus leaf in the shot. :)</td>', 'I like the idea but would have preferred to just have the shadow on her face and shoulder and not the out of focus leaf in the shot. :)', '2010-03-16 14:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906755, 859542, 61788, '<td valign="top">I wish there was something more in this image to make it more dramatic. Maybe someone/some face on this side so that it is more explicit that hand "wants to grab" something. Or maybe shadow on the other side. I think if shadow of the hand was little bit more blurry (farther toward tree) would be better too (but that is more questionable :). And light visible on left upper corener is distracting. All that said, I very much like idea, and execution too. It''s a great image - I just think you can make even better :)</td>', 'I wish there was something more in this image to make it more dramatic. Maybe someone/some face on this side so that it is more explicit that hand "wants to grab" something. Or maybe shadow on the other side. I think if shadow of the hand was little bit more blurry (farther toward tree) would be better too (but that is more questionable :). And light visible on left upper corener is distracting. All that said, I very much like idea, and execution too. It''s a great image - I just think you can make even better :)', '2010-03-16 14:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906757, 859338, 15711, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it so much more had the face been human. :)</td>', 'I would have liked it so much more had the face been human. :)', '2010-03-16 14:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906767, 859707, 113591, '<td valign="top">Nice, why is the front so blue? Doesn''t gel with rest of the photo.</td>', 'Nice, why is the front so blue? Doesn''t gel with rest of the photo.', '2010-03-16 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906768, 859764, 113591, '<td valign="top">Nice,</td>', 'Nice,', '2010-03-16 15:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906770, 858949, 61788, '<td valign="top">The color corners, even though they contribute to pretty strong diagonal (we associate with dynamic), are not contributing much to "shadows" challenge. They rather distract from the main subject. One way to handle is to convert to B/W. The other will be cropping tighter.</td>', 'The color corners, even though they contribute to pretty strong diagonal (we associate with dynamic), are not contributing much to "shadows" challenge. They rather distract from the main subject. One way to handle is to convert to B/W. The other will be cropping tighter.', '2010-03-16 15:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
