(5906815, 859494, 40391, '<td valign="top">I almost missed this photo - Just noticed that I had only completed 99% of votes. I''m glad I found it though as this is very clever (I hope you explain how you achieved this).  I''m not going to pick on the fact that the sun and shadows don''t align ;-).  This got an 8 from me - good luck.</td>', 'I almost missed this photo - Just noticed that I had only completed 99% of votes. I''m glad I found it though as this is very clever (I hope you explain how you achieved this).  I''m not going to pick on the fact that the sun and shadows don''t align ;-).  This got an 8 from me - good luck.', '2010-03-16 15:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906828, 858588, 40391, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to your photo and decided I had to change my vote from the original 9 I gave.  This is now my only 10 for the challenge!<br/> <br/>It''s beautifully captured and the B&amp;W works very well.  I gave you the exra point as I really appreciate photos that are captured well when not staged.  Being at the right place at the right time is one thing but capturing the shot showing the drama with the right amount of subject as well as nailing the challenge shows real skill.  I''ll be disappointed if this doesn''t get a ribbon.  Good luck.</td>', 'I keep coming back to your photo and decided I had to change my vote from the original 9 I gave.  This is now my only 10 for the challenge! It''s beautifully captured and the B&W works very well.  I gave you the exra point as I really appreciate photos that are captured well when not staged.  Being at the right place at the right time is one thing but capturing the shot showing the drama with the right amount of subject as well as nailing the challenge shows real skill.  I''ll be disappointed if this doesn''t get a ribbon.  Good luck.', '2010-03-16 15:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906839, 859294, 42181, '<td valign="top">Apart from the burnt patch on the wall it''s a great looking shot with some very interesting angles.</td>', 'Apart from the burnt patch on the wall it''s a great looking shot with some very interesting angles.', '2010-03-16 16:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
