(5907654, 858632, 106910, '<td valign="top">Yeah, based on the description - if there''s a shadow anywhere in the photo, it meets the criteria. Never said that the subject had to be a shadow. Nonetheless, I thought this picture had plenty of darkness to qualify for shadows, and the silhouette only accentuated the shadows. It was a 10 in my book.</td>', 'Yeah, based on the description - if there''s a shadow anywhere in the photo, it meets the criteria. Never said that the subject had to be a shadow. Nonetheless, I thought this picture had plenty of darkness to qualify for shadows, and the silhouette only accentuated the shadows. It was a 10 in my book.', '2010-03-17 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
