(5907939, 859341, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice one, Robert.  Whenever I see dunes, it always reminds me of our visits to South Padre Island when I was a little girl.  My dad would body surf and then we''d fill glass Coke bottles with a mixture of sand and water, to create Kremlin like spires atop our sandcastles.  Thanks for the memory. :)</td>', 'Nice one, Robert.  Whenever I see dunes, it always reminds me of our visits to South Padre Island when I was a little girl.  My dad would body surf and then we''d fill glass Coke bottles with a mixture of sand and water, to create Kremlin like spires atop our sandcastles.  Thanks for the memory. :)', '2010-03-17 08:52:05.000000', NULL, 0),
