(5908770, 858588, 105130, '<td valign="top">This is incredible! While I don''t want to take anything away from the top 3 photos from this challenge, I don''t understand why this didn''t take the top spot. If there''s anything I''ve learned from or about photography, it''s that you have to be in the right place at the right time to get THAT defining moment, and you did exactly that with this image. You can be very proud that you managed to capture this photo. Walk tall and be very proud of this achievement.</td>', 'This is incredible! While I don''t want to take anything away from the top 3 photos from this challenge, I don''t understand why this didn''t take the top spot. If there''s anything I''ve learned from or about photography, it''s that you have to be in the right place at the right time to get THAT defining moment, and you did exactly that with this image. You can be very proud that you managed to capture this photo. Walk tall and be very proud of this achievement.', '2010-03-17 18:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5908800, 859684, 60495, '<td valign="top">Kind of surprised with some of the low scores on this one, I was one of the ones that did not like the crop but still felt it was one of the better images. The shape of the shadow is what I really like, I love the way the person hunches over and looks like an old person stopping to give the neighbor dog a treat and the way the dog is so upright and anxious to get the treat. To me the shadow tells a story which is hard to do with just a shadow. Nicely done!</td>', 'Kind of surprised with some of the low scores on this one, I was one of the ones that did not like the crop but still felt it was one of the better images. The shape of the shadow is what I really like, I love the way the person hunches over and looks like an old person stopping to give the neighbor dog a treat and the way the dog is so upright and anxious to get the treat. To me the shadow tells a story which is hard to do with just a shadow. Nicely done!', '2010-03-17 18:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
