(5910974, 859782, 68769, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club.<br/>Hello Andrew, Im Alan.<br/> <br/>I think your second comment sums this image correctly, when you where just short of accused of a screen capture. I see in photographers comments you had a problem with your railing, but I think it fits the inspired scene well. Improvements there are few. One being the possible use of yellow transparent plastic sheets with a cut out in the center to give it that yellowed border, and added noise in PP (legal in basic) to give it that film nor look. Overall I think this was well presented, Thank You for giving me a fun image to critique this morning..<br/>If you have any questions on my insights please feel free to PM me.<br/>Alan.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.Hello Andrew, Im Alan. I think your second comment sums this image correctly, when you where just short of accused of a screen capture. I see in photographers comments you had a problem with your railing, but I think it fits the inspired scene well. Improvements there are few. One being the possible use of yellow transparent plastic sheets with a cut out in the center to give it that yellowed border, and added noise in PP (legal in basic) to give it that film nor look. Overall I think this was well presented, Thank You for giving me a fun image to critique this morning..If you have any questions on my insights please feel free to PM me.Alan.', '2010-03-20 09:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
