(5911581, 859783, 114997, '<td valign="top"><br/>Really crisp and clean...at first the sepia was a distraction, but the longer I looked at it the more I liked it. Kind of reminds me of a type of sunlight I see far too infrequently.</td>', 'Really crisp and clean...at first the sepia was a distraction, but the longer I looked at it the more I liked it. Kind of reminds me of a type of sunlight I see far too infrequently.', '2010-03-21 07:20:43.000000', NULL, 0),
