(5914956, 859353, 66709, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice! I like how the green of the grass becomes the green of the shadowtree''s leaves. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>More light away from the tree</td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: Nice! I like how the green of the grass becomes the green of the shadowtree''s leaves.   More light away from the tree', '2010-03-23 22:13:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915160, 858758, 61961, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pixelstate:</b></div><hr/><i> Taken on an iPhone 3Gs with App. (Not sure if this meets the submission criteria) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Really?  Wow!  You take more interesting photos with a camera phone than many do with a pro camera.  Super shot.<br/>(PS: I gave this a 9)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-24 00:22:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by pixelstate: Taken on an iPhone 3Gs with App. (Not sure if this meets the submission criteria)  Really?  Wow!  You take more interesting photos with a camera phone than many do with a pro camera.  Super shot.(PS: I gave this a 9)', '2010-03-24 00:21:44.000000', '2010-03-24 00:22:27.000000', 0),
